{\pard\sa200{\f0\fs22\b Per tournament (65 players avg @ \$26):}{\f0\fs22  Revenue \$1,690 | Costs ~\$350 | Margin ~\$1,340\par}}
{\pard\li400\sa80{\f0\fs22 \'95  Month 1: 1 game/week | ~\$952/mo games + \$1,340 tournament = ~\$2,292\par}}
